Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:35.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人克朗默觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Grace Archbishop Cranmer is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:43.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:46.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣誓效忠陛下为英国教会领袖一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have had a great success throughout the whole country
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:52.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已取得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the swearing of allegiance to Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:53.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巨大成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Head of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:57.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}支持您与安妮王后的婚姻亦是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also in favor of your marriage to Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们无法说服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we cannot persuade either
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:04.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔或是托马斯·莫尔宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fisher or Thomas More to swear the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:07.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而… 他们可以对其中的一部分进行宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However... they may swear to part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:10.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士已向我们表明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas has already told us he has no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:12.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对继承法案毫无异议 而且…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}argument with the Act of Succession,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:16.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不能让步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There can be no compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:18.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦允许他们如此行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For if we allow them,of all men,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按照自己的意志宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to swear to what they like,and not anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么其他人就会有先例可循\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then they set a precedent for others to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:26.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 在此事上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In this matter,Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有回旋余地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is all or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谨遵陛下旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.26,0:02:37.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大臣阁下 - 陛下 托马斯爵士之妻艾丽丝夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Secretary.  - Majesty,Dame Alice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:39.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}书信一封\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the wife of Sir Thomas has written.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:48.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她请求提醒您 她丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She asks to remind you that her husband
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长久以来为您效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has given long and true service,and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他并无恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he does nothing now out of malice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是出于自己的良知行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but only the imperatives of his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我深知他的良知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know all about his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.43,0:02:59.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他从不掩饰自己的良知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's been wearing it on his sleeve for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:02.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他辞去大法官一职时曾许诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When he resigned as Chancellor,he made me a great promise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就此不问世事 深居简出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he would retire from the world and live privately,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:07.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潜心修行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and attend his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:09.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而事实并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But this was not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他继续书写 刊印有关我的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He continued to write and publish pamphlets
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关我道德心的小册子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about my matter and my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:16.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他拜访过凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He visited Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:19.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他笼络其他人支持她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He cajoled others to support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:22.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换言之 他违背了自己的诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In other words,he broke his promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他必须承担相应的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must accept the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:36.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士 有人探访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas,you have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:39.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:48.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特 艾丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margaret! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:04:00.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔 我很惊异于你如此一个明智之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,Thomas More,I marvel that you have always been taken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:02.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在的所为却愚蠢不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for so wise a man that you will now play
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满足于呆在这闭锁 污秽的监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the fool here in this close,filthy prison
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:09.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与鼠辈同处一室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and be content apparently to be shut up among mice and rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't be like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证 这里是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure you this is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦塔里条件最好的一间房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one of the very best rooms in the Tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:22.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在形式上为警役的宾客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}formally,I am a guest of the Constable,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:25.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是刚刚带你们来的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who just brought you here. And I said to him before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾向他表明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that if I showed the least sign
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:29.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如若我有忘恩负义之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of ingratitude for his great generosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:33.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他完全可以把我从塔里扔出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he should just throw me out of the Tower altogether!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我们为何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know why we have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为是来探望我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought it was to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:43.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为看望你而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:48.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但除此之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But beyond that:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请求你宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was to ask you to swear the oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我们一家就可以团聚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that you can come home with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:58.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 艾丽丝 告诉我一件事 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Alice,tell me one thing. - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里是否和我自己的房间一样 如此接近天堂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is not this house as close to heaven as my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊 你想说的就是这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good God,man.Is that all you can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你总是这么坦率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were always plain-speaking,woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我钦佩你的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's one of the attributes I admire you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:17.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 恕我直言了 丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,then I should tell you plainly,husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:20.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 玛格丽特 你所有的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I,and Margaret...and all your other family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都已经宣过誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have all sworn the oath
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这无伤大雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and feel no worse for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:28.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不论男女 我都不会责备宣誓过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have always said that I do not blame any other man
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:32.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是我自己难以为之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or woman,who has sworn. I only say that I myself cannot swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就只在乎自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you are thinking only of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你被起诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you are proceeded against,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:39.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如你所知 所有财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you know very well,all your possessions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:40.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将收归王室所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be forfeited to the Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们从此会过上拮据的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we would be forced into penury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最为忧心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had more sleepless nights
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}over that issue than over anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:51.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你还是不肯宣誓吗 - 艾丽丝…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But still you will not swear? - Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:54.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你能谅解 求你了 我没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to understand,please. I do not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:58.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不是自讨苦吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not willingly seek martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:03.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会尽我所能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will do everything I can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:06.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迎合国王和他的期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to accommodate the King and his desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须牢记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must remember that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:14.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾向我许诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he once made me a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he would never
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:19.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强迫我做违背我良知的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}force me to do anything against my conscience:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝居首位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To look first unto God,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:26.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其次才是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and only after unto him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特 不必悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So,Margaret,don't be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:32.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:37.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我你没有生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}say you are not angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:39.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你离开 我带着这个想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you left,and I thought so,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:50.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会感到自己更加孤立无援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would feel even more lonely than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不生你的气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not angry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我被吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:03.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惊恐至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So very frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 怎么回事 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is it? - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:35.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Majesty. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:39.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my God. Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快传御医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get the physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我流产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lost the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:14.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们向我汇报了此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能将真相公之于众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall make no public announcement of the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:37.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:54.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此待命 费施尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand by. Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有两个消息通知你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came to bring you two pieces of news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:00.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:02.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇已任命你为红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Pope has made you a Cardinal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:06.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而坏消息是议会已颁布法令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the second is that Parliament
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:10.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶意否定国王在一切事物上至高无上的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has decreed that to maliciously deny the King's supremacy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:12.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将视为叛国罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all matters,is now a treasonable offence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}处以极刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:19.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再问你一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I ask you again:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:22.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否承认国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you accept the King
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为教会领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the Supreme Head of the Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:26.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并以此宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and take the oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:29.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已知我的答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You already know my answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的密探截获了这封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My agents intercepted this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:39.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此信意图向神圣罗马帝国皇帝求援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its intended recipient was the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:42.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}书信者乞求神圣罗马帝国皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In it,the writer begs the Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侵略英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to invade England and restore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让所谓的王后复位 恢复真理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what he is pleased to call the true Queen and the true faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:50.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你的所为吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you write this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:02.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In due course, Mr. Fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到时会因叛国罪接到传讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are to be arraigned for treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:11.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依国王陛下的旨意接受审问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will be tried according to his Majesty's pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:17.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Secretary,I must thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:20.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将我的冠冕送达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for bringing word of my new hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少不完全是坏消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least it was not all bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:45.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大使 请原谅我这般接见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me,Ambassador,for receiving you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:49.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到陛下如此情形 我甚感悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sad to find Your Majesty so unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何以惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it so surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔特郡伯爵一干人等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have received visits from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已到访此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Earl of Wiltshire and others,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:02.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们试图说服我宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trying to make me take the oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拒绝之后 便威胁我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and threatening me when I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波林说我必须被送上绞刑台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boleyn said I should be sent to the scaffold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:16.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信那男人绝对是撒旦的使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I truly believe that man to be an emissary of Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:18.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能不能给我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:21.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔主教的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what news of poor Bishop Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:25.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会刚刚通过了新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Parliament has passed a new
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:27.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛国罪法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Treasons Act
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以"恶意的"否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which makes "malicious" denial
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:32.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王的至尊地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the King's supremacy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就可以被判死刑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的费施尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是护卫我的雄狮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a lion in my defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今却要独自死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now he will die alone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:48.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在监狱中受辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and ashamed in a prison cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:59.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么会流产的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么特别的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:06.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定有什么 你做了什么才会流产的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course there was something! What did you do to kill the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:08.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信我 父亲 我一直小心翼翼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me,father,I was so careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:17.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但还远远不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not careful enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:26.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:27.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须十分谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we must all be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:31.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:34.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要留住国王的宠爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to lose the King's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:37.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则一切都将化为乌有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or everything is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:40.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我们所有人着想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:07.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯 我想问个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles. I want to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:11.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你睡过的女人中有没有隐瞒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have any of the women you've bedded ever lied
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不是处女的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about their virginity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:16.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}隐瞒？你应该换过来问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their virginity? I'd say it's the other way around:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有人不隐瞒的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did any of them not lie about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么这么问？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:27.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求国王陛下的宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask Your Majesty's forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:32.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要问的 你说实话就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I asked for the truth,and you told me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:42.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那是什么？- 下马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's this? - Dismount your horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}立刻下马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dismount now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早晨好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:59.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 早晨好 国王陛下 - 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good morrow,Your Majesty. - What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:02.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·韦伯 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}William Webbe,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:06.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是 我问你宝贝的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,your sweetheart's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:10.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝丝 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bess,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here,Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向陛下保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有许可令 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a permit and permission
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:29.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿越陛下的森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to ride through Your Majesty's forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:32.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓是真的 我可以证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear it and could easily prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello,Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:51.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的是英格兰的国王吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you really the King of England?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是拖拉你的腿(和你开个玩笑)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was only pulling your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ROME
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:33.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来自英格兰的朋友写道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our English friend writes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:38.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"那位女士根本没有怀孕"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that "the Lady is not to have a child after all."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还提到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He also says that the King
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:43.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王早就有出轨的行为了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has already been unfaithful to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这些都说明不了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But all this may mean nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"因为国王多变的性格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"considering the changeable character of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:52.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和那位女士玩弄他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the craft of the Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高超手段"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who well knows how to manage him."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们俩 坎佩基奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and I,Campeggio,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:01.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好地逃离了女人的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have done well to avoid the craft of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:05.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}禁欲一劳永逸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Celibacy is an immense relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:09.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们的朋友还是很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But our friend is still fearful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:12.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为凯瑟琳王后和他女儿的性命担忧不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the lives of Queen Katherine and her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:14.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要那个情妇掌权一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither of them is safe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的性命就受威胁一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as long as the concubine has power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会为我们的姐妹们祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have prayers said for our dear sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也会为费施尔红衣主教祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and also for Cardinal Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祈祷上帝能赐予他足够的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May God grant him the courage
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:27.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来承受即将经历的苦难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to endure his tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:31.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 圣父 - 另一方面 - 是的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes,Holy Father. - On the other hand... - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:36.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在教会创立的初期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the days of the founders of our Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殉教被认为是种特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was considered a privilege to be martyred,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:41.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像圣·彼得和其他使徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like St Peter and the other apostles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:46.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的教会是在这些殉教者的鲜血下建立起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our Church was founded upon the blood of these martyrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以对于你我来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So perhaps it is a pity that you and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:53.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坎佩基奥 不能像费施尔红衣主教那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Campeggio,unlike Cardinal Fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:59.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为耶稣而殉难 是种遗憾啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no longer have the opportunity to die for Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:09.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:12.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:24.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在这里 你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:27.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰 费施尔主教的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}John. A servant to Bishop Fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:29.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在被关在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is kept below here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:31.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他希望你高兴点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He asks you to be of good cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:38.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说实话先生 他已年迈 身体也不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Truth be told,Sir,he is old and not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:41.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他吃不了这儿的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He cannot eat the food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:45.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他的意志是坚定不移的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But his spirit remains ever unbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴听你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:50.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我一点儿也不惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And not the least bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He... he asks if you would ever
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:56.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会不会考虑发誓…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}contemplate taking the oath...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在什么情况下会考虑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and under what circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:03.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他若我发了誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him that I cannot take the oath
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:07.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的灵魂将受到永世的谴责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without damning my soul for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我不会发誓的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that I will not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,Sir,for that;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:15.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这肯定能使我的主人为之一振\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know it will renew my master's courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:18.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我必须要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:21.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:32.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me,Mr. Cromwell:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:35.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔还是那么冥顽不灵么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does Thomas More still continue in his stubbornness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:40.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你必须让他写下不发誓的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will force him to give his reasons for not taking the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:43.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则他的沉默将被认为是别有用意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or I will deem his silence on the matter to be malicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:47.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我任命你为宗教特使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am appointing you Viceregent in Spiritual Matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:50.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管你是个平信徒而非教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true you are a layman not a churchman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:51.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但在这个问题上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in this matter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不相信任何教士的偏见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not trust the prejudices of any churchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:30.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 你的姐姐来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady,your sister has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:43.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 妹妹 - 玛莉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sister...  - Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:46.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:49.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有孩子了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are with child!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:53.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这怎么回事？我们都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How has it happened? We knew nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:56.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:58.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结婚了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:01.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:03.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你丈夫是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:06.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他叫威廉·斯塔福德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name is Mr. William Stafford.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:10.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没听说过 他在宫庭任职吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't heard of him. Is he at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:14.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉是个小人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}William is a man of little standing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:17.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没什么钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在他在加来服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is now a serving soldier in Calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you think him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:35.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}配得上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}worthy to be the husband
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:37.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰王后的姐姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Queen of England's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 父亲 因为我爱他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,father. Since I love him and I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:41.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你完全搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are very much mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:45.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们私下结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You married him in secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:48.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都没得到我们的允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and without asking our approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像他这种废物我决不会答应的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is such a nothing we could never have given our permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲如果你能见见他 你会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father if you were to meet him,you would see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正直 善良 诚实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he is a good,fine,honest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:00.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于你厚颜无耻的举动 玛莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since you acted brazenly and in spite of me,Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不得不取消对你的年金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall cut off your allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:05.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看 你和你善良 诚实的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your fine,honest young man
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:08.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就慢慢等死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can rot in hell,as far as I am concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:15.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道找到一个合适的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How easy do you think it was for me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:19.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我而言有多困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to find a proper husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:22.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我一直被称作妓女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I was called the great prostitute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:25.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遇到威廉 他能爱上我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed I think myself fortunate to have found William,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直认为是我天大的福气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to be loved by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:29.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没经过我的允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did not ask my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:32.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我要有你的允许才能爱吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do I have to ask your permission to fall in love?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:36.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在是皇室成员了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now we are royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.05,0:21:38.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切不同往昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求求你了 妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please,sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和你的丈夫将被驱逐出宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your husband are banished from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.09,0:22:32.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:39.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要我为您做什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How may I please you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:44.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would please me very much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:46.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you could give me the reason or
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不发誓的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}reasons why you will not take the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:51.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:55.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已把那些事忘得一干二净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}discharged my mind of all such matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:58.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管是国王还是教皇的头衔 都不关我事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will no more dispute King's titles,nor Pope's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:05.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若你不给出原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King accuses you of stubbornness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:08.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王将以固执而指控予你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and obstinacy,for not giving your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.39,0:23:13.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须讲出你对这个法令的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must have some view of the statute?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have this view that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.39,0:23:18.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会的这个法案就像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the act of Parliament is like a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:20.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一把双刃剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}double-edged sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一种回答会使身体受难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for if a man answers one way it confounds his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.31,0:23:26.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而另一种回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if he answers another
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:27.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将使灵魂受难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it confounds his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:31.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果你总不表态 会招致惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But by not answering at all,you will incur penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.19,0:23:34.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下已经命我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty has commanded me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:36.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}起草剥夺你的公民权和财产权的议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to draw up an act of attainder against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:40.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这将让你在监狱度过下半生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This will make your imprisonment permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的艾丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:45.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么就不能宣誓呢 很多人都已经接受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why will you not take the oath? Thousands have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:55.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信其中有许多人和你有同样的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many,I am sure,share your beliefs and your faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:23:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但没有你的迟疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet,not your scruples.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:01.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于此 一些人可能是为利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,as for that,some may do it for favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:05.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一些人是怕惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and some for fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.45,0:24:08.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一些人可能想着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And some may perhaps think they can
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.36,0:24:10.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们日后的悔改能为上帝听到并被宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}later repent and be shriven,and God will forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:16.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一些人会认为如果他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And some others may be of a mind that if they
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.09,0:24:19.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说一套 做一套 那么他们即使宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}say one thing,but think another,then their oath
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.55,0:24:21.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也能依据自己的想法做事 而非自己的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}goes upon what they think and not upon what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:28.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但对如此重大的事情我不能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I cannot use such ways in so great a matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:34.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:37.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然你如此诚实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and in all honesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.78,0:24:39.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.26,0:24:44.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会付出极大的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are likely to pay the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.77,0:24:54.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 我们俩其实没什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell,there really is no difference between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.40,0:24:57.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是我会今日死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except that I shall die today,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.23,0:24:59.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你会明天亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.06,0:25:23.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不好意思 您是玛格丽特·莫尔吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me,but aren't you Margaret More,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:25.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士的女儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas' daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.67,0:25:29.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 先生 - 我是尤斯塔斯·乔普斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes,sir. - I am Eustace Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:30.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王国大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Emperor's Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能与和托马斯·莫尔爵士有关的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a great pleasure for me to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.63,0:25:35.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相见 实在是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anyone associated with Thomas More.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:37.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢您 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.36,0:25:39.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知您来宫廷有何贵干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask why you have come to court?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:43.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来求克伦威尔大臣阁下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have come to petition Mr. Secretary Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:46.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近 我们大部分的地被售出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lately most of our lands have been sold off
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.03,0:25:49.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的家族正逐渐穷困下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and my family is gradually reduced to poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:51.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的母亲正处境艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Things go very hard with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:53.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很抱歉你遭遇如此不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.02,0:25:57.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对这个王国里发生的许多事情感到伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sorry for many things that are occurring in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:25:59.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好人要受罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The good seem to suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坏人却逍遥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the wicked to prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.57,0:26:06.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh! Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.99,0:26:08.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.81,0:26:11.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你无拘无束 我很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a free spirit. I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:20.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他人都在我面前很拘谨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone else constrains me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.65,0:26:22.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人理解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:27.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.82,0:27:10.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}姐姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:17.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我睡不着 不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't sleep. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:20.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么睡不着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why could you not sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.81,0:27:22.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在想她的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was thinking of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:25.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:27.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在想谁的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thinking of who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:31.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然是玛丽小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lady Mary,of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:33.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有她妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And her mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:36.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.99,0:27:39.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 凯瑟琳 你怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. Katherine! What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.80,0:27:43.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.98,0:27:45.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们还能对你有什么威胁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What harm can they do you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.27,0:27:49.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极大的威胁 只要玛丽活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every harm! As long as Mary is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.26,0:27:51.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就有可能成为女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She could be Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:54.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:57.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继承法案规定那不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Act of Succession makes it impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.94,0:28:00.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白 你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elizabeth,your daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:03.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会继承王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be made heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.61,0:28:05.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但国王会改变主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the King can change his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.71,0:28:09.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在能随心所欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can do whatever he wills now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:12.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有绝对权利 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has absolute power. You know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.50,0:28:16.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他赐予的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what he has given,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.85,0:28:18.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他能拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he can take away,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:21.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而被他拿走的又能被再次赐予\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and what taken away,he can give back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:25.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可以继续授予玛丽女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he could still make Mary Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.44,0:28:27.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至在我女儿之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even above my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:33.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可他干嘛那么做？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But why should he?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.74,0:28:35.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是怕那会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:45.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我对玛丽的理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is all I know of Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:49.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我置她于死地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she is my death,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.74,0:28:53.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是我被她所杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I am hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.54,0:28:57.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们祖宗的天主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Benedicant te,Domine,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:29:01.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有你配得赞美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}omnes angeli et santi tui.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.58,0:29:03.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的名号是世世代代应受颂扬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Benedicant te caeli,terra,mare,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.92,0:29:05.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸天及你的一切造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et omnia quae in eis sunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.89,0:29:07.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都应赞颂你于无穷之世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In te speravi,Domine:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:09.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你创造了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tu es Deus meus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:10.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- … 托马斯爵士 - 约翰…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- ...Sir Thomas! - John...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.47,0:29:17.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你吗 约翰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that you,John?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.97,0:29:21.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的主人 费舍尔主教被判决有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My master,Cardinal Fisher,is found guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:22.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并将在明天被执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and is called forth tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.70,0:29:26.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他希望你和他能尽早在天堂相会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He hopes you and he shall soon meet in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.82,0:29:28.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他一定如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him that will be the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:32.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们殊途同归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for it is a very strait gate we are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.53,0:29:33.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}John...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.94,0:29:38.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰… 告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}John... tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.85,0:29:40.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他配得上并将会得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he deserves and will receive
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所有来自天堂的祝福 - 是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- all of heaven's graces. - Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.79,0:29:46.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿主保佑您 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:03.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿主保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:10.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以圣父 圣子 及圣灵之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In nomine Patris et Filii et Spiritus Sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.12,0:30:16.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看见了 我穿来了最好的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see that I am wearing my finest clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.35,0:30:20.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为今天是我大喜的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for today is my wedding day!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:21.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.92,0:30:26.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求你们爱戴吾王并跟随他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you to love the King and obey him,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.83,0:30:28.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他本质不坏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for he is good by nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.56,0:30:33.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使他的宗教政策并不正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even if he is not right in his religious policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.28,0:30:38.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我却因希望维护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am condemned to die for wishing to uphold
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:40.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝及宗座的荣耀而被处刑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the honor of God and the Holy See...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:45.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 我的天主子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now,good Christian people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.93,0:30:48.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求你们的祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask for your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是具肉身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am only flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.77,0:30:53.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和任何人一样都怕死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fear death as much as any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.69,0:30:55.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的确是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true that I have
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.55,0:30:58.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早就做好了赴死的准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}long since made up my mind to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:31:01.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果需要我为耶稣和他的教会殉教…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if need be,for Christ and His Church...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.03,0:31:06.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在 死亡时刻已经到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now that the moment is at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.61,0:31:11.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.37,0:31:15.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 费舍尔红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you,Cardinal Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.37,0:31:45.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:58.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不像那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not like that asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:32:02.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩西画的看起来就像是堆垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moses looks like a pile of crap
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.99,0:32:20.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 圣父 - 你知道那是谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Holy Father! - Do you know who that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.90,0:32:22.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.70,0:32:28.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米开朗琪罗·路多维可·利奥纳多·博那罗蒂·西蒙尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michelagniolo di Ludovico di Lionardo di Buonnarroti Simoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.03,0:32:32.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米开朗琪罗？是他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michelangelo? That was him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.47,0:32:34.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他 我们原谅他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was him. We forgive him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:36.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他是个天才…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he is a genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:39.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管那意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.21,0:32:41.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇陛下 我们从英格兰得到消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holiness,we have heard from England
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:44.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔主教已被谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the murder of Cardinal Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.34,0:32:47.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的头被利斧砍下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His head was struck from his body with an axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.64,0:32:50.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经听说了 这是一起暴行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have already heard. It is an outrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:53.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已追封费施尔为教会亲王…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had made Fisher a Prince of the Church...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.13,0:32:55.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这对亨利国王毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it mattered nothing to King Henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.39,0:32:58.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在已恶习缠身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is now so mired in vice
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.27,0:33:01.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欲望不止 他已经失去理智了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and lust that he is beyond reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:12.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 既然费施尔已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,now that Fisher is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.98,0:33:15.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该怎么处置莫尔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what is to be done about More?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.82,0:33:26.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续施压 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should press ahead,Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.72,0:33:29.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续施压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should press ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.91,0:33:42.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 这里发生了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father,what has happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.90,0:33:45.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得他们对你不如以前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to me that they are treating you worse than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:49.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们拿走了我的炉子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,they've taken my stove,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.82,0:33:52.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和一些衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.73,0:33:56.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的食物供给减少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My food is reduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:33:57.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 现在你还要怎么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father how can you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.23,0:33:58.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margaret,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.12,0:34:03.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定不要为我担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you must not be concerned about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.18,0:34:09.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经冥思了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've thought long and hard
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.22,0:34:12.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于基督的受难和死亡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about Christ's Passion and pain and...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不惧怕死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not afraid of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.23,0:34:20.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只怕受刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am only afraid of torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.57,0:34:25.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他们用暴力让我屈服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they use violent ways to make me swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.05,0:34:29.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道我能有多勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know how brave I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.50,0:34:32.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你不用遭受任何苦难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you do not have to suffer anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣誓就是了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just take the oath...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:38.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.23,0:34:39.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像其他人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like everyone has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.27,0:34:43.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要说出它 你会获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just say it; and your body will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.62,0:34:46.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我要出卖灵魂才能获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the saving of my body,will be at the expense of my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.91,0:34:48.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不是 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No!  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.97,0:34:52.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的 我们都不相信那些话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. None of us believes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.85,0:35:06.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.74,0:35:08.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:13.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在你爱我们的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the love I know you bear us,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:15.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't do this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:22.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Secretary...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.58,0:35:25.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德·瑞奇爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Richard Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.07,0:35:28.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德爵士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Richard...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:31.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴能见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very pleased to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.77,0:35:36.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给你个事儿做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.42,0:35:55.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.13,0:35:59.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他就不能像别人一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can he not be like others?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.44,0:36:02.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为什么要和我对着干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does he have to cross me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.05,0:36:04.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他比国王还要自负？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can his vanity be greater than a king's?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.02,0:36:08.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这困扰着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.59,0:36:11.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它占据着我的意识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It ways on my conscience and my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.55,0:36:13.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的心又劳累又悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is full and heavy and sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.18,0:36:18.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只对你说这些 只对你坦白这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say this only to you. I confess only to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.91,0:36:20.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我欣赏他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.17,0:36:23.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也憎恶他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.05,0:36:26.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的恨和爱一样多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate in equal measure to my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.57,0:36:28.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他否定我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for he is the spirit that denies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.09,0:36:31.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这取决与您的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is up to you to judge,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.21,0:36:33.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底会不会使我良心难安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whether or not,he be on my conscience!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:41.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.06,0:36:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:48.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看我的牢房快成了律师会面室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see my cell is fast becoming the place for lawyers to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起… 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am afraid,Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.01,0:36:54.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很不情愿的奉命来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I come here most unwillingly for I am ordered to
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.74,0:36:57.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没收你的所有书籍和纸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}deprive you of all your books and papers...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.71,0:36:59.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸如此类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and suchlike.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.55,0:37:03.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:09.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然 你奉命前来 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still,if you are ordered to,I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.54,0:37:13.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I suppose there is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.75,0:37:19.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最好开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You had best get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.09,0:37:43.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能问个问题吗 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask you a question,Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.02,0:37:46.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能是假设性的问题 理查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only if it's a hypothetical one,Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:50.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那样比较好 - 假设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's better that way.  - Suppose,then,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:53.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会颁布了一项法令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Parliament enacted a bill
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.52,0:37:55.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣布我 理查德·瑞奇为国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to say that I,Richard Rich,was King,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.03,0:37:58.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否认的人将视为叛国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that it would be treason to deny it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.31,0:38:00.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会接受我为国王吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would you accept me as King?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.15,0:38:02.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.55,0:38:08.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是让我用另一个假设来回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But let me counter with another hypothetical case:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:09.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}假设国会颁布法案宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Suppose Parliament enacted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.33,0:38:12.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God's not God,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.48,0:38:16.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不承认即视为叛国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to oppose the act would be treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.83,0:38:20.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会承认上帝不存在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would you say that God was not God?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.70,0:38:24.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会 因为国会无法制定这样的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Since no parliament can make any such law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:27.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们没有资格决定上帝是否存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has no competence to decide on the existence of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会也就没有资格决定国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And no more can Parliament make the King
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.73,0:38:32.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能否成为教会的最高领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Supreme Head of the Church!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:39.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那好 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There,Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.44,0:38:41.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我的差事做完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.69,0:39:02.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下 国王驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty,the King is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.06,0:39:14.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.09,0:39:27.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.26,0:39:36.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我是否还有激情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you still have a passion for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.42,0:39:39.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do,sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.97,0:39:41.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.18,0:39:49.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 别哭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There now. Don't weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.46,0:39:52.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别哭泣 我心爱的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't weep,my own darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.15,0:39:55.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:59.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.41,0:40:23.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威斯敏斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Westminster
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.29,0:40:50.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士 你将在这个委员会前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas More,you are arraigned before this commission
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.30,0:40:53.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以叛国罪名接受公诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on charges of high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.45,0:40:55.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对此项指控如何回答？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you answer the charges?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.20,0:41:02.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先我要否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me begin by denying
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.99,0:41:04.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未恶意反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I ever maliciously opposed
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.59,0:41:07.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王与安妮·博林的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the King's marriage to Anne Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:09.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未对此发表恶意言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never spoken maliciously against it...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.30,0:41:13.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有且也仅限于我的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but only sometimes according to my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.93,0:41:16.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意见与良知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}opinion and my conscience...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.77,0:41:20.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并因此遭受痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have suffered as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.85,0:41:25.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你恶意否认了《至尊法案》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you have maliciously denied the Act of Supremacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.94,0:41:27.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我一直对此沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I have been silent upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.30,0:41:31.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我的缄默而言 不管是你们的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for all my taciturnity neither your law
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.43,0:41:32.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是世上任何一部法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor any law in the world is
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.14,0:41:34.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都无法因此公正合法的问刑于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}able, justly and rightly, to condemn me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.98,0:41:37.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非你有我确凿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless you may also lay to my charge
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.84,0:41:40.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}语言或行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}either some word or some deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.10,0:41:45.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的沉默也可视为一种行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your silence can easily be construed as an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.51,0:41:46.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使在此情形下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,but even in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.75,0:41:49.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沉默的约定俗成定义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the presumption that silence gives consent
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.20,0:41:51.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰恰能让对我的指控无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}precludes the charge against me:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.30,0:41:53.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]沉默 即为默许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Qui tacet,consentire videtur."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.31,0:42:00.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the charge that,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.15,0:42:05.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与费施尔主教同谋谋反的罪名有何回应？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you conspired in prison with Bishop Fisher a convicted traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.08,0:42:07.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在狱中从未见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never met him in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.17,0:42:10.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和他的仆人也只有只言片语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only talked a little with his servant
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.57,0:42:17.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家常话或勉励而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about familiar things and recommendations,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.18,0:42:19.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们相识已久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such as were seemly to our long acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.05,0:42:31.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们回到你假定沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We go back to your supposed silence
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.10,0:42:32.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与《至尊法令》的指控上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the Act of Supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.99,0:42:35.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们认为你就此的确发表过言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We think you have in fact spoken about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.99,0:42:37.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有目击证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we have a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.93,0:42:39.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传副总检察长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call the solicitor general.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.59,0:42:41.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传理查德·瑞奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call,Mr. Richard Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:03.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德 你已立誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Richard,you are under oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.20,0:43:05.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能否坦诚的告诉本委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you tell this commission,truthfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.86,0:43:09.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 被告到底对你说过什么？- 是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- what the accused said to you on this matter. - Yes,sirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.90,0:43:13.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都同意国会不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We agreed that Parliament might not make
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.19,0:43:15.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}制定否认上帝存在的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}any such law that God was not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.06,0:43:17.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就此事托马斯爵士说道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To which Sir Thomas said:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.04,0:43:20.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"国会也同样不能确立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"No more could Parliament make
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.35,0:43:22.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王为教会的最高领袖"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the king Supreme Head of the Church."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.85,0:43:26.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说他恶意否认了国王的权威？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So he maliciously denied the King's authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.24,0:43:30.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这些是原话？- 是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- In those words?  - Yes,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.92,0:43:32.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字字属实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In those exact words.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.76,0:43:49.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将负责本委员会相应裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I will charge this commission to return a true verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.89,0:43:52.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请诸位大人一起裁定是否托马斯·莫尔爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you,good sirs,to determine whether Sir Thomas More
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.87,0:43:55.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在与理查德·瑞奇爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did converse with Sir Richard Rich
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.04,0:43:58.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的对话中发表了主张性的言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the manner alleged?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.28,0:44:04.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们也认为他有罪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do so find him guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.37,0:44:11.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然如此 我将对犯人进行宣判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I will proceed in judgement against the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.94,0:44:16.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法官大人 当我做律师时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord,when I was a lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.91,0:44:19.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法庭惯例是在判决前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the convention was to ask the prisoner
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.33,0:44:20.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先由犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before judgement was given,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.50,0:44:23.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为自己做最后的辩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why judgement should not be given against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.17,0:44:27.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么好吧 你可为自己辩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What,then,are you able to say to the contrary?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.51,0:44:29.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.36,0:44:35.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依我之见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To my view,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.01,0:44:38.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这项控告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this indictment is
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.33,0:44:41.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是基于一项直接对立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}grounded upon an act of Parliament
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.99,0:44:46.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于上帝律法和其神圣教会的法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}directly repugnant to the laws of God and His Holy Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:49.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其最高领袖地位不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the supreme governance of which
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.62,0:44:55.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由任何世俗君王自行以任何法律形式自封\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no temporal prince may presume by any law to take unto himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.74,0:44:58.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它属于… 它属于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It belongs... It belongs
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.51,0:45:01.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它只合法属于罗马教廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by right to the See of Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.13,0:45:03.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣彼得和他的继任者们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to St Peter and his successors...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:06.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此乃救世主在世时的亲口教诲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as our Saviour told us Himself when He was on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.87,0:45:13.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个王国 作为教会延伸的一小部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This realm,being but one small part of the Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.13,0:45:17.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可制定任何特别法律 抵触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cannot make any particular law, disagreeable to the
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.60,0:45:22.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基督律法与普世天主教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}general laws of Christ's universal Catholic Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.06,0:45:23.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.81,0:45:28.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰王国不可拒绝服从罗马教廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No more can this realm of England refuse obedience to Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.55,0:45:32.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就如同生子不可不认其生父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than can a child refuse obedience to his own natural father...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:39.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在明白无误地看清你的恶意倾向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We now plainly see that you are maliciously bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.86,0:45:41.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 大人们 绝无恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,sirs. Not maliciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.33,0:45:46.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿我们今后都能在天堂快乐的相遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope we may all meet merrily in heaven hereafter...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.45,0:45:49.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祈求全能的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I desire Almighty God to preserve and
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.99,0:45:51.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保佑国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}defend the King's Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.88,0:45:56.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为他遣来忠臣良言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to send him good counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.79,0:46:00.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas More,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.37,0:46:03.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将被绑在囚笼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are to be drawn on a hurdle
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.15,0:46:06.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拖过全伦敦城到泰柏恩行刑场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through the City of London to Tyburn,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.40,0:46:10.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在刑场上吊到半死之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there to be hanged till you be half dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.18,0:46:14.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}趁没断气前从绳索上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after that cut down alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.16,0:46:17.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挖出你的肚肠撕下你的心肺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your bowels to be taken out of your body
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.66,0:46:19.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你面前烧掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and burned before you,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.59,0:46:21.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}割去你的生殖器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your privy parts cut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.32,0:46:24.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}砍掉你的头颅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your head cut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.54,0:46:28.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将你的身体肢解成4段…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your body to be divided in four parts...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.17,0:46:39.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 请保佑我们 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father, bless us, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.47,0:46:43.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保佑你们 我的孩子们 振作起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bless you,my children. Be of good cheer,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.65,0:46:46.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祈祷在天堂中与你们重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I pray that we will meet together in heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.23,0:47:04.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何时行刑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When is the execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.64,0:47:06.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.11,0:47:11.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天几号？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What date is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.18,0:47:15.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}7月6日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The 6th of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.59,0:47:21.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几时？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What time?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.11,0:47:25.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上午10点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At ten in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.12,0:48:05.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决定将判决减刑为砍头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have decided to commute the sentence to beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.37,0:48:07.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谕令行刑官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell the officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.59,0:48:12.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.47,0:48:33.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于怜悯 我们恳求主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pietate tua,quaessumus Domine,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.61,0:48:37.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}免除我们的罪责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nostrorum solve vincula peccatorum.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.05,0:48:42.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奉童贞圣母玛利亚之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Et intercedente beata Maria semper virgine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.89,0:48:47.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们永做您忠实的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nos famulos tuos in omni sanctitate custodi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.24,0:48:54.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因主耶稣基督之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Per Christum Dominum nostrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.28,0:49:47.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 汉弗莱爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Sir Humphrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.60,0:49:51.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我再跌倒的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But when I come down again,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.40,0:49:54.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我自行处理吧 随其自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let me shift for myself,as well as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.03,0:50:21.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求你们为我作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you to bear witness with me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.38,0:50:24.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我即将从容就死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I shall now suffer death in
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.22,0:50:28.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殉教于神圣的天主教会的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and for the faith of the Holy Catholic Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.92,0:50:39.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我诚挚地乞求你们为国王祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you earnestly to pray for the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.40,0:50:40.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并转告他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.22,0:50:44.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我死也是他的忠诚仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I died his good servant
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.74,0:50:47.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我首先服从上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but God's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.65,0:50:55.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您的原谅和祝愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask for your pardon and blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.05,0:51:01.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天你将给我以任何凡夫俗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will give me this day a greater benefit than any mortal man
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:03.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都无法给予的恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can ever be able to give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.27,0:51:07.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鼓起勇气 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pluck up your spirits,man,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.64,0:51:10.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不必惧怕履行自己的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and be not afraid to do your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.07,0:51:36.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求主怜悯 恳求您的宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miserere miti Domime,secundum miseration un tuum.
